1
//----------------------------------------------------------------------
// Messages and Time
// The messages of each invasion (numbers of the list in the last part), how long it lasts and how many times it opens.
//   Invasion: The invasion these settings belong to.
//   Message when it appears: The number of the message (in the last part) shown when the NPC appears.
//   Message when it leaves: The number of the message (in the last part) shown when the NPC leaves.
//   Announced in: 0 Only the map where it appears | 1 The whole server
//   Lasts (seconds): Seconds the NPC stays before it leaves.
//   Times it opens: How many times players can use the NPC before it is closed. Empty or -1 means no limit.
//----------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~99]    [1~6500]    [1~6500]    [Number]     [Number]    [1~99]
//  ID        Appears     GoodBye     AllServer    DurTime     OpenCount
//----------------------------------------------------------------------
    1         1           2           1            10          1            // NPC Shop
end


2
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// NPC Respawn
// Where each NPC appears.
//   Invasion: The invasion this NPC belongs to.
//   Group: Each group spawns one NPC: one of its rows, picked at random. Several rows in the same group are different places the NPC can appear.
//   NPC: The NPC (or monster) that appears.
//   Map: The map where it appears.
//   From X: Left edge of the area where it appears; the exact spot is picked at random inside the area.
//   From Y: Top edge of the area where it appears.
//   To X: Right edge of the area where it appears.
//   To Y: Bottom edge of the area where it appears.
//   Direction: The way the NPC faces. Random picks one each time.
//   NPC Manager file: The number of the file in NPCManager that makes this NPC work.
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~99]    [0~19]    [Number]    [Number]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [0~255]    [*/0~6]    [Number]
//  ID        Group     NPC         Map         X          Y          X2         Y2         Dir        NPCManager
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    1         0         380         0           140        120        140        120        3          11
end


3
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Message List
// The texts of the invasion messages (up to 60 characters).
//   Number: The number the messages part of the invasion points to.
//   Message: Up to 60 characters.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  Index    Message
//----------------------------------------------------------
    1        "Aparecio a buscarlo!!!"
    2        "Se fue el npc!!!"
end